msgid ""
"\n"
"                    ENGLISH GROWS is a commercial name registered with the\n"
"                    Spanish Patent and Trademark Office (OEPM), with "
"separate\n"
"                    denominative and figurative registrations:\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ENGLISH GROWS es un nombre comercial registrado en la Oficina Española de Patentes y Marcas (OEPM), con registros denominativo y figurativo independientes:"

